00:36:02.535 --> 00:36:04.526
What the hell?


00:36:06.506 --> 00:36:07.734
Shit.


00:36:07.774 --> 00:36:09.765
Get your hands in the air.


00:36:15.348 --> 00:36:17.248
Monix, bail's been set.


00:36:23.689 --> 00:36:25.350
Lynn, can I ask you a favor?


00:36:25.391 --> 00:36:28.326
You mean besides
bailing your ass outta jail?


00:36:28.361 --> 00:36:30.158
Lynn, no one can drain it like you.


00:36:31.664 --> 00:36:34.656
I think I drained all I can out of there.


00:36:34.700 --> 00:36:36.861
- That hurt?
- Not really.


00:36:36.903 --> 00:36:39.269
- How about that?
- Yeah.


00:36:39.305 --> 00:36:40.704
Good.


00:36:42.675 --> 00:36:47.305
Listen. This is long overdue,
but I wanna apologize.


00:36:48.614 --> 00:36:50.548
For what?


00:36:50.583 --> 00:36:55.919
For, you know, back then
we had some problems.


00:36:55.955 --> 00:36:59.686
Did you wanna apologize
for cheating on me?


00:37:00.259 --> 00:37:02.090
Twice.


00:37:02.128 --> 00:37:03.720
Hey, I cheated on you once.


00:37:03.763 --> 00:37:07.199
There just happened
to be two girls there.


00:37:07.233 --> 00:37:10.430
- Still not funny?
- Still not funny.


00:37:11.804 --> 00:37:13.795
And where's the necklace I made you?


00:37:16.809 --> 00:37:19.209
Monix, it was the high point
of your career.


00:37:19.245 --> 00:37:20.803
I didn't deserve that ring, Lynn.


00:37:20.847 --> 00:37:24.715
I hardly played.
I was never the guy to hit the big shot.


00:37:24.750 --> 00:37:27.480
Wanna know why
things didn't work out between us?


00:37:27.520 --> 00:37:28.509
Yeah.


00:37:28.554 --> 00:37:33.014
You hate yourself so much
it's impossible to love you.


00:37:35.027 --> 00:37:37.120
Kinda brutally honest.


00:37:40.166 --> 00:37:42.566
Did we have some fun?


00:37:42.602 --> 00:37:43.933
You're kind of fun.


00:37:43.970 --> 00:37:46.734
Didn't we?


00:37:46.772 --> 00:37:49.172
Sometimes.


00:37:56.516 --> 00:37:59.917
- What are you doing?
- There he is.


00:37:59.952 --> 00:38:03.353
- Been lookin' all over for you.
- Like it. Sweaty.


00:38:03.389 --> 00:38:06.119
See ya later, Ed. 'Scuse me, guys.


00:38:06.159 --> 00:38:07.490
Excused.


00:38:07.527 --> 00:38:10.928
Doin' your girl in the locker room?
Classy.


00:38:10.963 --> 00:38:14.922
- What are you guys doin' here?
- We want you to coach the team.


00:38:16.536 --> 00:38:18.800
