- You know the game better than Jackie.


00:38:18.838 --> 00:38:22.934
I'm flattered, but I don't think
Jackie would be too happy about this.


00:38:22.975 --> 00:38:26.536
Come on, don't worry about Jackie.
I mean, I got this.


00:38:26.579 --> 00:38:28.410
OK, Tropics, hustle up.


00:38:29.615 --> 00:38:31.674
Five, six, seven, eight.


00:38:31.717 --> 00:38:35.744
One and two and three and four,
and turn like you mean it.


00:38:35.788 --> 00:38:37.085
Arch that back, Bee Bee.


00:38:37.123 --> 00:38:39.523
I like it. Good rotation.


00:38:39.559 --> 00:38:40.787
Beautiful, seahorses.


00:38:40.826 --> 00:38:42.123
Leg kick, Scootsie.


00:38:42.161 --> 00:38:45.062
Nice! And freeze it.


00:38:49.635 --> 00:38:50.932
And then we start the game.


00:38:50.970 --> 00:38:51.959
Now, when I say freeze it...


00:38:52.004 --> 00:38:54.564
you guys gotta freeze it, OK?


00:38:54.774 --> 00:38:57.572
- Hey!
- Hey.


00:38:57.610 --> 00:38:59.168
You're back. All right.


00:38:59.212 --> 00:39:02.306
We got a extra costume
right over there for you.


00:39:02.348 --> 00:39:07.081
I'm not here to do whatever this is.
What is this?


00:39:07.119 --> 00:39:12.921
What is this? Come on, man,
this is the future of basketball, OK?


00:39:12.959 --> 00:39:16.554
This is entertainment.
You'll get it. You'll catch on.


00:39:21.133 --> 00:39:24.933
Look, Jackie. Now, don't get mad,
but some of us got together...


00:39:24.971 --> 00:39:27.531
and we aksed old Monix
if he'd teach us a little bit.


00:39:27.573 --> 00:39:29.666
Wait, what do you mean, teach us?


00:39:29.709 --> 00:39:34.476
I teach you guys things.
Like expert choreography and stuff.


00:39:34.513 --> 00:39:36.572
No.


00:39:36.616 --> 00:39:40.313
We wanna give Monix
a chance to coach, Coach.


00:39:41.721 --> 00:39:44.315
What's goin' on here?


00:39:45.324 --> 00:39:46.985
What is this?


00:39:48.995 --> 00:39:50.326
Clarence?


00:39:52.832 --> 00:39:55.460
This is a mutiny.


00:39:56.636 --> 00:39:59.104
You guys all in on this?


00:40:02.875 --> 00:40:05.901
You motherfuckin' cocksuckers.


00:40:05.945 --> 00:40:08.072
All of you.


00:40:08.914 --> 00:40:13.283
I have dedicated my life
to this team, OK?


00:40:13.319 --> 00:40:15.685
I have given you guys my soul!


00:40:17.256 --> 00:40:20.657
I mean, who bought you
those boots last Halloween?


00:40:20.693 --> 00:40:23.161
That would be you, Coach.
You bought us those boots.


00:40:23.195 --> 00:40:24.184
I bought 'em!


00:40:24.230 --> 00:40:25.891
I really liked them boots.
They were nice.


00:40:25.931 --> 00:40:28.092
They're really nice boots.


00:40:28.134 --> 00:40:29.726
Yeah, we love ya.


00:40:29.769 --> 00:40:33.933
But Monix just knows
the X's and O's, baby. That's all.


00:40:33.973 --> 00:40:36.874
Come on, come on,
don't turn your back on us.


00:40:36.909 --> 00:40:39.537
Hey, hey, hey, hey, hey. Listen.


00:40:40.546 --> 00:40:45.279
How about this, I'll be the offensive
and defensive coordinator...


00:40:45.318 --> 00:40:48.412
and you can still be head coach.


00:40:49.255 --> 00:40:53.021
And you're the best promoter.
We gonna need fans, right?


00:40:54.126 --> 00:40:55.923
Do you guys really think
I'm a good promoter?


00:40:55.961 --> 00:40:58.862
- Yeah, yeah, yeah.
- You know you are, man.


00:40:58.898 --> 00:41:01.890
- I'm probably the best in the league.
- Yeah, that's what they say.


00:41:01.934 --> 00:41:03.299
- Top three.
- Yup.


00:41:03.336 --> 00:41:05.201
- Right up there.
- Yeah.


00:41:05.237 --> 00:41:07.000
OK.


00:41:09.875 --> 00:41:15.074
If we play unselfish, fundamental
basketball, we can make a run at this.


00:41:15.848 --> 00:41:20.979
By unselfish, I mean we sprint up
the court on every fast break...


00:41:21.020 --> 00:41:24.717
not because we might get a dunk and
get your dick sucked after the game...


00:41:24.757 --> 00:41:28.124
but because sprinting might pull
the defense out of position...


00:41:28.160 --> 00:41:30.492
Wait, wait, wait, wait. So what's goin' on
with the blow jobs again?


00:41:30.529 --> 00:41:32.759
Yeah, 'cause I vote
we keep them blow jobs, Jack.


00:41:32.798 --> 00:41:36.666
- Yeah. All in favor?
- Come on, let the man talk.


00:41:36.702 --> 00:41:38.397
Thank you, Clarence.


00:41:38.437 --> 00:41:41.634
Now, till we start playing
like a real team...


00:41:43.309 --> 00:41:46.278
