00:46:55.154 --> 00:46:56.746
God damn it, Vakidis!


00:46:56.789 --> 00:46:58.484
Learn fuckin' English!


00:47:00.292 --> 00:47:04.558
Corn dogs, Jackie!
Corn dogs for all these people.


00:47:04.596 --> 00:47:09.033
The Tropics win,
and this crowd is going crazy.


00:47:09.068 --> 00:47:11.263
Crazy for corn dogs.


00:47:11.303 --> 00:47:16.240
